<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP bids for nonfat dry milk.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP bids for nonfat dry milk.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Monday it acccepted DEIP bids from Agri-Best Dairy Products Inc and M.E. Franks Inc to sell a total of 180 tonnes of nonfat dry milk to the Caribbean and Central and South America.</p>
<p>USDA said the bonus was $755.56 per tonne and delivery was set for Feb 10-May 15.</p>
